flowchart TB
  subgraph Main[Browser main thread]
    DartWeb[Dart, compiled with dart2wasm or dart2js<br/>the same aud_audio API]
    Glue[JS glue<br/>MessagePort, SharedArrayBuffer ring buffers]
  end
  subgraph Worker[Wasm Worker — control runtime]
    Ctl[Compiles graphs, loads assets, frees<br/>shares the module heap when isolated]
  end
  subgraph Worklet[AudioWorkletGlobalScope — render thread]
    Wasm[aud_audio engine and DSP packages<br/>one WebAssembly module built by Emscripten]
  end
  WebAudio[Web Audio<br/>AudioContext destination, getUserMedia input]
  DartWeb --> Glue -->|commands, events| Wasm
  Glue -->|transactions| Ctl -->|prepared plans| Wasm
  WebAudio <-->|render quantum| Wasm
